    <div class="col-sm-10 col-lg-9 mx-auto">
      <h3 class="pb-4">Investing</h3>
      <hr class="style-one">

      <div class="row pt-4">
        <div class="col-sm-6">
          <h4>Philosophy</h4>
          <p class="info-text">
            Long-term business owner mindset. Concentrated positions, high conviction,
            valuation discipline at entry. Not a trader.
          </p>
          <p class="info-text">
            The quality filter does most of the work — avoid bad businesses and bad
            management before asking if something is cheap. Asymmetric risk-reward
            as the entry condition. Behavioral self-awareness as a discipline:
            identifying and correcting the gap between insight and execution.
          </p>
          <p class="info-text">
            Two parallel systems: one for capital acceleration, one for permanent
            quality ownership.
          </p>
          <p class="info-text">
            First-generation wealth builder. Money as a decision unlocker, not a scorecard.
          </p>
        </div>
