            Warren Buffett &middot; Charlie Munger &middot; Mohnish Pabrai &middot;
            Stan Druckenmiller &middot; David Einhorn &middot; Pulak Prasad &middot;
            Rakesh Jhunjhunwala &middot; Vijay Kedia &middot; Sanjay Bakshi &middot;
            Nick Sleep
          </p>
        </div>
